    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts, are delighted to present No. 44 Cashel Road to the market. This charming extended two-bedroom, two-bathroom home comes to the market in excellent condition throughout and offers a wonderful opportunity for any discerning purchaser seeking a home in one of Crumlin's most established and sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, you are welcomed by an entrance porch and hallway that immediately creates a warm and inviting atmosphere. To the front of the property lies a spacious reception room complete with a feature fireplace, providing the perfect setting to relax and unwind. Double doors lead through to the extended kitchen and dining area, a bright and practical space designed for modern family living. A large picture window draws your eye to the beautiful rear garden, where a generous patio and mature planting create a wonderfully private setting, ideal for enjoying long summer evenings or entertaining family and friends. There is great potential for future development of the extension SPP. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises two generous double bedrooms, both benefitting from fitted wardrobes, along with a fully tiled family bathroom, completing the first floor.\r\n\r\nNo. 44 enjoys an enviable position in the heart of Crumlin, with an excellent selection of cafés, shops, parks, sports clubs and both primary and secondary schools all within easy reach. Rialto, Kimmage and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible, while a number of regular bus routes, together with the nearby M50 and N7, provide excellent connectivity to the city and beyond.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this wonderful home has to offer.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\nExtended two-bedroom, two-bathroom home\r\nBeautifully maintained large rear garden\r\nOff-street parking\r\nExternal insulation\r\nExcellent location\r\nBright and spacious accommodation"
      },
      {
